{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/main/sarif-2.1/schema/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json", "runs": [{"columnKind": "utf16CodeUnits", "originalUriBaseIds": {"ROOTPATH": {"uri": "file:///corpus/seeded/"}}, "results": [{"level": "error", "locations": [{"message": {"text": "main.tf"}, "physicalLocation": {"artifactLocation": {"uri": "main.tf", "uriBaseId": "ROOTPATH"}, "region": {"endColumn": 1, "endLine": 27, "startColumn": 1, "startLine": 27}}}], "message": {"text": "Artifact: main.tf\nType: terraform\nVulnerability AWS-0107\nSeverity: HIGH\nMessage: Security group rule allows unrestricted ingress from any IP address.\nLink: [AWS-0107](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/aws-0107)"}, "ruleId": "AWS-0107", "ruleIndex": 0}], "tool": {"driver": {"fullName": "Trivy Vulnerability Scanner", "informationUri": "https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy", "name": "Trivy", "rules": [{"defaultConfiguration": {"level": "error"}, "fullDescription": {"text": "Security groups provide stateful filtering of ingress and egress network traffic to AWS\nresources. It is recommended that no security group allows unrestricted ingress access to\nremote server administration ports, such as SSH to port 22 and RDP to port 3389.\n"}, "help": {"markdown": "**Misconfiguration AWS-0107**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Terraform Security Check|HIGH|Security groups should not allow unrestricted ingress to SSH or RDP from any IP address.|Security group rule allows unrestricted ingress from any IP address.|[AWS-0107](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/aws-0107)|\n\nSecurity groups provide stateful filtering of ingress and egress network traffic to AWS\nresources. It is recommended that no security group allows unrestricted ingress access to\nremote server administration ports, such as SSH to port 22 and RDP to port 3389.\n", "text": "Misconfiguration AWS-0107\nType: Terraform Security Check\nSeverity: HIGH\nCheck: Security groups should not allow unrestricted ingress to SSH or RDP from any IP address.\nMessage: Security group rule allows unrestricted ingress from any IP address.\nLink: [AWS-0107](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/aws-0107)\nSecurity groups provide stateful filtering of ingress and egress network traffic to AWS\nresources. It is recommended that no security group allows unrestricted ingress access to\nremote server administration ports, such as SSH to port 22 and RDP to port 3389.\n"}, "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/aws-0107", "id": "AWS-0107", "name": "Misconfiguration", "properties": {"precision": "very-high", "security-severity": "8.0", "tags": ["misconfiguration", "security", "HIGH"]}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Security groups should not allow unrestricted ingress to SSH or RDP from any IP address."}}], "version": "0.71.2"}}}], "version": "2.1.0"}